    "product.workspace_lifecycle": {
      "rationale": "The basic list/current/create/select/rename/close v2 and CLI entry points are exact across the retained 19-case differential. The broad umbrella also includes navigation, ordering, groups, restore, persistence, remote workspaces, and workspace.action semantics that this lane does not yet verify.",
